Description: pwm: add pwm-imx1 in Rust
 The same driver as pwm-imx1.c, beside it and off by default, on the waveform callbacks that
 Rust's PWM abstraction requires.
Author: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [AI generated code]
Signed-off-by: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
